      "title": "Constellation Brands Q2 Earnings Top Estimates on Beer and Wine Growth",
      "summary": "Constellation Brands (STZ) reported Q2 fiscal 2027 earnings of $3.74 per share, beating consensus estimates, with net sales rising 6% to $2.63 billion. Beer sales grew 5% and wine/spirits jumped 17%, though operating margins contracted 160 basis points. Despite solid results, the stock fell over 4% after-hours. The company reaffirmed full-year guidance and acquired SpikedAde for $75 million to expand its ready-to-drink portfolio.",
